{
    "title": "Event Planner: Birthday, Party",
    "description": "Looking for a birthday planner or maybe you need a wedding or anniversary organizer? Our event planner is what you need! TopEvent is a simple app for planning any holidays \ud83c\udf88\r\n\r\nKeep track of important tasks, manage guest list, control event budget, etc. Such sections of the app as Checklist, Guests, Budget, Schedule will help you with this.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>KEEP TRACK OF TASKS</b>\r\nAdd tasks and track their progress. Group tasks into categories or divide them into subtasks. Event planner will remind you of upcoming purchases or meetings.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>MANAGE GUEST LIST</b>\r\nMake a list of guests and companions. Divide guests into groups and tables, plan menus. Our party planner will help you analyze everything: gender, age, RSVPs, invitations, attending\u2026\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>CONTROL EXPENSES</b>\r\nSpecify an event budget, generate expenses and mark upcoming payments. TopEvent will optimize the budget of the party and will tell you how to save money!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>MANAGE VENDOR LIST</b>\r\nMake a list of vendors with contacts and other information. Planner will help you make the right choice and control the costs.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>FOLLOW THE PLAN</b>\r\nCreate a schedule for the event day and keep track of each milestone. The app will verify that everything goes according to plan.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b>PLAN EVENT TOGETHER</b>\r\nJoin helpers and organize your event with friends. Manage your event with different devices and accounts. Your data will be synced instantly!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89  <b>EVENT COUNTDOWN</b>\r\nInstall beautiful widgets and track the days until the event.\r\n\r\nAnd that's not all\u2026 There are many more features in the app that will simplify the preparation for any holidays: wedding, bachelorette and bachelor party, anniversary, birthday, Christmas party or any business events.\r\n\r\n<i>Event planning's never been so easy! Install the app and see for yourself!</i>\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://topevent.app/legal/privacy/\r\nTerms of Use: https://topevent.app/legal/terms_of_use/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a birthday planner or maybe you need a wedding or anniversary organizer? Our event planner is what you need! TopEvent is a simple app for planning any holidays \ud83c\udf88<br><br>Keep track of important tasks, manage guest list, control event budget, etc. Such sections of the app as Checklist, Guests, Budget, Schedule will help you with this.<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 <b>KEEP TRACK OF TASKS</b><br>Add tasks and track their progress. Group tasks into categories or divide them into subtasks. Event planner will remind you of upcoming purchases or meetings.<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 <b>MANAGE GUEST LIST</b><br>Make a list of guests and companions. Divide guests into groups and tables, plan menus. Our party planner will help you analyze everything: gender, age, RSVPs, invitations, attending\u2026<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 <b>CONTROL EXPENSES</b><br>Specify an event budget, generate expenses and mark upcoming payments. TopEvent will optimize the budget of the party and will tell you how to save money!<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 <b>MANAGE VENDOR LIST</b><br>Make a list of vendors with contacts and other information. Planner will help you make the right choice and control the costs.<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 <b>FOLLOW THE PLAN</b><br>Create a schedule for the event day and keep track of each milestone. The app will verify that everything goes according to plan.<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 <b>PLAN EVENT TOGETHER</b><br>Join helpers and organize your event with friends. Manage your event with different devices and accounts. Your data will be synced instantly!<br><br>\ud83c\udf89  <b>EVENT COUNTDOWN</b><br>Install beautiful widgets and track the days until the event.<br><br>And that&#39;s not all\u2026 There are many more features in the app that will simplify the preparation for any holidays: wedding, bachelorette and bachelor party, anniversary, birthday, Christmas party or any business events.<br><br><i>Event planning&#39;s never been so easy! Install the app and see for your